  "details": "For people who primarily speak other languages like Spanish, Japanese, Chinese, etc., it can be difficult to find and enjoy content on VRChat because most world and avatar names are only in English. This creates a language barrier that limits accessibility and discoverability.\n\nI think we should have the option to add names and descriptions in other languages when uploading worlds and avatars. This way, creators can make their content more welcoming and easier to find for a global audience.\n\nEven just letting us add localized names and tags for different languages would go a long way in making VRChat more inclusive and user-friendly for non-English speakers.",
